# Frontend — components and reuse

**Language:** English in `<script>` and comments; **pt-BR** in user-visible template copy — `docs/LANGUAGE.md`.

**Priority:** avoid repetitive code. ADR-016: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` · ADR-018 (UI/motion): `docs/ADR-018-frontend-ui-motion-stack.md` · Guide: `docs/FRONTEND_COMPONENTS.md`.

## Two UI philosophies (ADR-018)

| Surface | Host | Stack | Motion |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Admin / login** | `app.*` | **Nuxt UI** — fast, responsive | ❌ No Lenis/GSAP/WebGL |
| **Platform** | apex | **Nuxt UI** | ⚠️ Light optional |
| **Public tenant** | `{slug}.*` | Custom `public/tenants/{slug}/` + `themes/{slug}.css` | ✅ **Heavy motion** (GSAP, Lenis, [Vue Bits](https://vue-bits.dev/), …) |
| **Other** | dev, error | `surface-dark` | ❌ Structural only |

## Mandatory rules

1. **Dark (`surface-dark`)** — admin, login, platform, dev skeleton, `error.vue`, `components/app/`.
2. **Artist theme** — only on layout `tenant` routes at `{slug}.*`.
3. **New tenant UI** = `public/tenants/{slug}/` + `themes/{slug}.css`.
4. **Never** customize admin per tenant; **never** use Nuxt UI as the main identity of the artist site.
5. **Never** import GSAP/Lenis/Three in `components/app/`.

## Anti-patterns

- Heavy motion on `/login`, `/admin`, `components/app/`.
- Generic Nuxt UI on tenant hero/gallery (use per-slug components).
- Manual per-tenant imports in composables.
- Login on `{slug}.*`.
- English user-facing copy in product UI (use **pt-BR**).
